{"text": "Inside the time machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were two other travelers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Eckels sat down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And closed his eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He felt the machine moving. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Under his feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After only a few minutes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The machine stopped. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We have just arrived. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the jungle of 60 million years ago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Travis explained. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do you see the path over there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must not leave it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At any time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not touch anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You might kill something. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By accident. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A little change here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Can cause something unthinkable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the future. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Slowly everyone got out of the time machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The jungle was covered in fog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was very quiet.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", " ", "m", "a", "c", "h", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "c", "l", "o", "s", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", 